#api call for user registration
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"delsa",
    "email":"delsajames@gmail.com",
    "password":"delsa@123",
    "phone":"7034567889",
    "role":"faculty"
}

#api call for token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/token/
